 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Units of meaning",
     "texto": [
      "**tage stilling til** = to take a position on; **føre til** = to lead to; **lægge mærke til** = to notice. The particle can be separated from the verb and the complement comes after it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Changes of meaning",
     "texto": [
      "**tage** doesn't mean «take» in every expression: **tage højde for** = to take into account; **tage ansvar for** = to take responsibility for. Learn the full combination and its complement."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
